              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "seacretslott"
            },
            "reviewBody": "this recipe was very good. the marinade was perfect. i used rockfish instead of shark, but i'm guessing any firm whitefish would work. i paired this recipe with a ten minute enchilada sauce. i skipped the frying and went straight to a baking dish, smothered with the enchilada sauce, and topped it with cheese at the very end. very good flavors",
